# Scoped Component Registry (web)

This ledger tracks the distilled, active building blocks of the repository across the scope tiers below so future features and pipelines can reference and recombine them by ID without re-reading raw source files.

## Scope tiers
1. `GLOBAL`: repo-wide design tokens, typography pairs, global middleware
2. `ARCHETYPE:<name>`: shared across a family of pages or a domain context
3. `FEATURE:<name>`: scoped to one feature slice
4. `ATOM`: single-element micro-interaction or helper co-located inside a component

